# Best practices (backend)

**JSON camelCase** — все API: `AddJsonOptions(o => o.JsonSerializerOptions.PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonNamingPolicy.CamelCase)`.

DRY, KISS, YAGNI. Код ревью: слои (Domain → Application → Infrastructure → API), тесты, безопасность, CQRS/MediatR.
